#. y1:english="What's the matter?\nOh,{PA:10} I rebuilt a shack.\nBut I might've got the wrong measurements.||{MS:0}It's shaky...\nIt will collapse any minute. I wonder||if there is any way to reinforce it...\nGive him something?\n\nWhat?{PA:10} You mean I should use it?||{MS:0}Thanks for your advice,\nbut I don't think it will work.\nI have to reinforce my house now,||or it will collapse any minute.{PA:20}\nWhat should I do about it...\n(I have nothing to give him...)\nOhh!!{PA:20}||Where did you get it?\nThis is the adhesive tape the company\nI used to work for had been trying to||develop...\nIt's an old story now...{PA:20}\nYou could build a house||only with the adhesive tape...\nWe used to work like dogs to develop||that kind of next-generation tape...\nSo... It has been developed!\nThank you.||Thank you very much!\nI'd like to return a favour...||How about this one?\nYou got the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Silver Briefcase{CR:00}\".\nHuh?{PA:10} What's this?\nI found it somewhere.||{MS:0}I don't know what's inside though...\nTo return the favour to you,||{MS:0}this is the item I only have.\nPlease take it.\nYou gained 500 exp.\n"
